<http://www.spektrix.com/chesterplayhousenovascotia/event/33601ABMMCLRHCDGJGLSCVTKRJSMDCMSS>
  a schema:Event;
  schema:name "9 to 5";
  schema:description """
	<img src=\"https://system.spektrix.com/chesterplayhousenovascotia/files/d4a616ba-e170-4b9c-89ab-ea199e25d0f7.jpg\" /><span><br/></span><h1> 9 to 5</h1><span><br/></span>Join us as we celebrate the incredible life and legacy of actor, musician, and philanthropist Dolly Parton with a special screening of the box-office smash hit <span class=\"ItalicText\">9 to 5</span>!<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Jane Fonda, Lily Tomlin, and Dabney Coleman join Dolly in this hilarious office satire about three female secretaries who take matters into their own hands after enduring the tyranny and sexism of their chauvinistic boss. When they imagine a way to get revenge, their wild plan sets off a series of unforgettable events—and ultimately puts the women in charge of the business themselves.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>A true classic, <span class=\"ItalicText\">9 to 5</span> is made even more memorable by Dolly Parton’s iconic title song, which earned her two Grammy Awards for Best Country Song and Best Country Vocal Performance Female, and received an Academy Award nomination for Best Original Song.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Come out to the Chester Playhouse on November 8th and experience this larger-than-life performer on the big screen one more time!<span><br/></span><span><br/></span><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=CGtFlLtgA78/\">Watch the Trailer!</a><span><br/></span><span><br/></span><span class=\"BoldText\">When</span> <span><br/></span>Sunday, November 8th at 2:00 pm<span><br/></span><span class=\"ItalicText\">1 hour and 50 minutes</span><span><br/></span><span><br/></span><span class=\"BoldText\">Tickets</span><span><br/></span>Adults -<span class=\"BoldText\">$17.00</span> ($12.28+ tax & $3 Building Reserve Fee)<span><br/></span>Youth (4-19) -<span class=\"BoldText\">$9</span>  ($5.26 + tax & $3 Building Reserve Fee) <span><br/></span>$10 Community Tickets use code <span class=\"BoldText\">10FOR10</span> (<span class=\"ItalicText\">limit of 10 per performance</span>)<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Rating: PG<span><br/></span>Genre: Comedy<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Admission includes complimentary popcorn.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>General Admission<span><br/></span>Doors open 45 mins before the show.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>The Chester Playhouse is wheelchair accessible. Please call the Box Office at (902) 275-3933 to arrange accessible seating.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Babes in arms & children under 4 are not permitted in the theatre.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span><span><br/></span>
""";
