<http://www.spektrix.com/chesterplayhousenovascotia/event/33801ASNTMSCGCRRHSPSCJNKGBMBPNMSP>
  a schema:Event;
  schema:name "A Christmas Story";
  schema:description """
	<img src=\"https://system.spektrix.com/chesterplayhousenovascotia/files/babc3b1a-e141-4caf-9855-9a9092cdcaa1.jpg\" /><span><br/></span><h1>A Christmas Story</h1>a part of the Chester Village Christmas!<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Join us in Chester for Chester Village Christmas and a big-screen showing of the holiday classic <span class=\"ItalicText\">A Christmas Story</span>! <span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Based on the humorous writings of author Jean Shepherd, this beloved holiday movie follows the wintry exploits of youngster Ralphie Parker (Peter Billingsley), who spends most of his time dodging a bully (Zack Ward) and dreaming of his ideal Christmas gift, a \"Red Ryder air rifle.\" Frequently at odds with his cranky dad (Darren McGavin) but comforted by his doting mother (Melinda Dillon), Ralphie struggles to make it to Christmas Day with his glasses and his hopes intact.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>“<span class=\"ItalicText\">It's impossible to watch A Christmas Story and not remember what it felt like to be a kid during the holidays</span>.” - DVDJournal<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>“<span class=\"ItalicText\">A Christmas Story's message is aimed at children and at the child in all of us for whom the Spirit of Christmas is alive and well</span>.”  - Three Movie Buffs<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>With a special <span class=\"BoldText\">$5 ticket price</span> for everyone, there’s no better time to enjoy the magic of the holidays at Chester Playhouse!  Don’t delay—book your tickets today and get ready to celebrate the season with us!<span><br/></span><span><br/></span><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=EubdGeiZOcE\">Watch the Trailer!</a><span><br/></span><span><br/></span><span class=\"BoldText\">When</span> <span><br/></span>Sunday, November 29th at 2:00 pm<span><br/></span><span class=\"ItalicText\">1 hour and 33 minutes</span><span><br/></span><span><br/></span><span class=\"BoldText\">Tickets</span><span><br/></span>Alltix (4-19) -<span class=\"BoldText\">$5.00</span> ($1.75+ tax & $3 Building Reserve Fee)<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Rating: PG<span><br/></span>Genre: Holiday, Family, Comedy<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Admission includes complimentary popcorn.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>General Admission<span><br/></span>Doors open 45 mins before the show.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>The Chester Playhouse is wheelchair accessible. Please call the Box Office at (902) 275-3933 to arrange accessible seating.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Babes in arms & children under 4 are not permitted in the theatre.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span><span><br/></span>
""";
