<http://www.spektrix.com/chesterplayhousenovascotia/event/34201ASMCSDCJKPKGCLJTKVRDGQJPPMJH>
  a schema:Event;
  schema:name "Scene Study Intensive (Fall)";
  schema:description """
	<img src=\"https://system.spektrix.com/chesterplayhousenovascotia/files/600a84d0-603e-40e2-92bb-3e1878a22981.jpg\" /><span><br/></span><h1>Scene Study Intensive </h1><span><br/></span>Explore working with dramatic text and build your acting muscles in this <span class=\"ItalicText\">Scene Study Intensive</span> for adult actors! <span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Over the course of six successive Monday nights, participants will work on scenes from Modern Classics and Contemporary plays. All classes take place directly onstage at The Chester Playhouse, offering a wonderful opportunity to play on a professional stage.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Come explore characters and scenes while having fun and creating connections in your community, and deepening your craft of acting.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Join us for this fun, creative, and enriching class as you move “from page… to stage”!  <span><br/></span><span><br/></span>This class is intended for adults aged <span class=\"BoldText\">19 and up</span>.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span><span class=\"BoldText\">Prerequisite</span>: This acting intensive is designed for adults with previous acting experience or participation in Chester Playhouse adult acting classes, or with special permission of the instructor.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>This class will be held on the Chester Playhouse stage. The Chester Playhouse is accessible by lift. <span><br/></span><span><br/></span><span class=\"BoldText\">Dates</span>: Mondays, Oct 19th - Nov 23rd<span><br/></span><span><br/></span><span class=\"BoldText\">Time</span>: 4:30pm - 6:30pm<span><br/></span><span><br/></span><span class=\"BoldText\">Ages</span>: 19+<span><br/></span><span><br/></span><span class=\"BoldText\">Registration Fee</span>:<span><br/></span> $228 ($200 + tax) *Please note $50 of the fee is non-refundable.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span><span class=\"BoldText\">Max Registration</span>: 12 participants<span><br/></span><span><br/></span><span class=\"BoldText\">Instructor</span> - Kristina Nicoll<span><br/></span>
""";
