<http://www.spektrix.com/chesterplayhousenovascotia/event/35601ALVJGKRTKBQLPHGRMJPNQQKSPRPT>
  a schema:Event;
  schema:name "The Nutcracker - The Royal Ballet ";
  schema:description """
	<img src=\"https://system.spektrix.com/chesterplayhousenovascotia/files/aad0601a-e28c-43a7-b1d3-1067db7dd0bb.jpg\" /><span><br/></span><h1>The Nutcracker - The Royal Ballet in Cinemas</h1><h2>Filmed Ballet</h2>North American Re-release, filmed live December 10, 2025<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>We’re sprinkling a little sugar-plum magic into your holiday season as we bring a screening of a filmed performance of Tchaikovsky’s beloved <span class=\"ItalicText\">The Nutcracker</span> by the Royal Ballet to Chester Playhouse!<span><br/></span><span><br/></span><span class=\"ItalicText\">Synopsis</span>:<span><br/></span>At a cosy Christmas party, young Clara meets the mysterious magician Drosselmeyer, who gives her a nutcracker doll. When the guests have departed and the house is asleep, Clara sneaks downstairs in search of the doll. Instead, she finds Drosselmeyer, who whisks her away on a journey into a whole world of enchantment: fantastical landscapes of flurried snow and glittering confection where toys come alive and the magic never stops.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Peter Wright’s production of this festive family favourite sparkles to the wondrous swell of Tchaikovsky’s orchestral score, alongside the glow and grandeur of Julia Trevelyan Oman’s period designs.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Join us for this beloved holiday tradition. <span><br/></span><span><br/></span><span class=\"BoldText\">*Please note that this is not a live ballet performance - this is a screening of a performance that was filmed. </span><span><br/></span><span><br/></span><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://youtu.be/KvHrztAlmko/\">Watch the Trailer!</a><span><br/></span><span><br/></span><span class=\"BoldText\">When</span> <span><br/></span>Saturday, December 5th at 7:00 pm<span><br/></span>Sunday, December 6th at 2:00 pm<span><br/></span><span class=\"ItalicText\">2hrs 20min, plus one intermission</span><span><br/></span><span><br/></span><span class=\"BoldText\">Tickets</span><span><br/></span>Adults -<span class=\"BoldText\">$23.00</span> ($17.54+ tax & $3 Building Reserve Fee)<span><br/></span>Youth (4-19) -<span class=\"BoldText\">$11.50</span>  ($7.45 + tax & $3 Building Reserve Fee) <span><br/></span>$10 Community Tickets use code <span class=\"BoldText\">10FOR10</span> (<span class=\"ItalicText\">limit of 10 per performance</span>)<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Genre: Filmed Ballet<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Admission includes complimentary popcorn.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>General Admission<span><br/></span>Doors open 45 mins before the show.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>The Chester Playhouse is wheelchair accessible. Please call the Box Office at (902) 275-3933 to arrange accessible seating.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Babes in arms & children under 4 are not permitted in the theatre.<span><br/></span>
""";
