<http://www.spektrix.com/chesterplayhousenovascotia/event/35001ANDBMVNTNMQTQBCTTLTMVTJHVKBV>
  a schema:Event;
  schema:name "White Christmas";
  schema:description """
	<img src=\"https://system.spektrix.com/chesterplayhousenovascotia/files/a1e27799-1d2a-4267-8e79-f56eb274affd.jpg\" /><span><br/></span><h1>White Christmas</h1><span><br/></span>As the holidays draw near, join us one last time in 2026 for a timeless holiday classic and experience <span class=\"ItalicText\">White Christmas</span> on the big screen at your Chester Playhouse.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span><span class=\"ItalicText\">Synopsis</span>:<span><br/></span>Two talented song and dance men (Bing Crosby and Danny Kaye) team up after the war to become one of the hottest acts in show business. One winter they join forces with a sister act (Rosemary Clooney and Vera-Ellen) and trek to Vermont for a white Christmas. The result is stuff dreams are made of.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>“<span class=\"ItalicText\">This was the Mamma Mia! of its day, a nostalgic blast of popular Irving Berlin showtunes gift-wrapped in new-fangled VistaVision that danced its way to the top of the 1954 box office.</span>” - Total Film<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>“<span class=\"ItalicText\">There have been few song and dance stars in cinematic history more universally loved that Bing Crosby and Danny Kaye, so to see them come together in this Christmas classic is a real treat</span>.”- Eye for Film<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Gather your friends and family and make it part of your holiday tradition! We can’t wait to celebrate the season with you!<span><br/></span><span><br/></span><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=mQ1Hl1ZcdBI\">Watch the Trailer!</a><span><br/></span><span><br/></span><span class=\"BoldText\">When</span> <span><br/></span>Sunday, December 20th at 2:00 pm<span><br/></span><span class=\"ItalicText\">2 hours</span><span><br/></span><span><br/></span><span class=\"BoldText\">Tickets</span><span><br/></span>Adults -<span class=\"BoldText\">$17.00</span> ($12.28+ tax & $3 Building Reserve Fee)<span><br/></span>Youth (4-19) -<span class=\"BoldText\">$9</span>  ($5.26 + tax & $3 Building Reserve Fee) <span><br/></span>$10 Community Tickets use code <span class=\"BoldText\">10FOR10</span> (<span class=\"ItalicText\">limit of 10 per performance</span>)<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Rating: PG<span><br/></span>Genre: Holiday, Musical<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Admission includes complimentary popcorn.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>General Admission<span><br/></span>Doors open 45 mins before the show.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>The Chester Playhouse is wheelchair accessible. Please call the Box Office at (902) 275-3933 to arrange accessible seating.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Babes in arms & children under 4 are not permitted in the theatre.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span><span><br/></span><span><br/></span>
""";
